    {
      "run": 1,
      "steps": 4,
      "narrative": "After entering the cramped galley, a thorough examination of the space commenced. It appeared exceedingly salty, with a kettle found lying on the floor, noticeably dented on one side. The kettle was picked up, revealing its battered condition but finding no further objects of interest in the immediate vicinity. The exploration did not yield any additional discoveries. The option to proceed north through a doorway presented itself, but that action was pending further instructions. Meanwhile, the hatch to the south was left unopened and its contents remained undiscovered. The session concluded with the kettle in possession and the decision yet to be made regarding the direction to take next.",
