    {
      "run": 2,
      "steps": 4,
      "narrative": "Upon entering the galley, cluttered and tainted with salt, I noticed a kettle on the ground. Taking the kettle, I proceeded to explore further. My journey led me to a store smelling strongly of paraffin, its shelves scantily filled. Here, a coil of rope caught my eye lying on the floor. Acting on impulse, I picked it up. The store connected to the south via a doorway, to the north via a path to a workshop, and ascended to the east via stairs. During this brief exploration, I managed to collect both the kettle and the coil of rope, but due to the constraints, I was unable to interact with the workshop, the stairway, or any other potential areas of interest or items outside of the galley and the store.",
